Domain list snapshot: hand-audited 2026-08-22.
Coverage: portals, search, e-commerce, video, social, news,
government (.gov.cn), education (.edu.cn), finance, cloud,
CDNs, AI services, developer tools, ISPs/telecom, mail,
logistics, auto, real estate, travel, restaurants.
Source mix: covers the bulk of the canonical Chinese
internet surface plus the most popular Chinese-language
international sites reachable on a domestic broadband link.
Refresh: re-run scripts/gen_cn_top1000.py to regenerate.
